  "notes": "Itochu labels fiscal years by start year (「2026年度」= 2027年3月期). Per-year pages: https://www.itochu.co.jp/ja/ir/financial_statements/<fy>/index.html. The page shows only 「決算短信」 as link text, so titles are composed from the page's 年度/四半期 headings plus link text. Dates are not shown on the library page; they are the 決算公表 dates from Itochu's IR news list (/ja/ir/news/<year>/index.html). Since FY2025 Q1, Itochu re-discloses the Q1/Q3 決算短信 after the auditor's interim review (e.g. FY2027 Q1 reissued 2026-08-06, FY2026 Q3 2026-02-13, FY2026 Q1 2025-08-06, FY2025 Q3 2025-02-12, FY2025 Q1 2024-08-09); the library links point to that reviewed version, while `date` is the original announcement date. Presentation = 「決算説明資料（第N四半期）」 for Q1-Q3 and the 決算実績・経営計画説明資料 for Q4 (not the スクリプト付 version, Q&A, or セグメント別成長期待領域 supplements). Several presentation PDFs were re-uploaded later (afieldfile dates 2024/06/06, 2026/02/09). Newest published: FY2027 Q1 (2026年度第1四半期, 2026-08-03); FY2027 Q2 not yet published as of 2026-10-27."
